<description><![CDATA[<div>每周的订阅邮件中，我们会附上值得大家阅读的 <a href="?q=%23%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0">#推荐文章</a> 。以下是<a href="https://outsightchina.substack.com/p/348" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">本周邮件</a>中的推荐阅读列表：<br/><br/>纽约时报 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9trtyy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">孙悟空爱上林黛玉：中国AI短剧怎么成了“不当婚恋”</a><br/><blockquote>数千条孙悟空爱上林黛玉的AI视频遭下架，平台称其“不当婚恋”，官方定性为恶意篡改名著。</blockquote><br/><br/>BBC | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9trtz5" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国“养老”人数首次超过“养小”</a><br/><blockquote>中国65岁以上老人达2.23亿，数量首次超过儿童，每100名劳动力就要养23个老人。</blockquote><br/><br/>普通人ThePeople | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9trtz9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">峰哥镜头之外的马驹桥，一位53岁女工说她被工头骚扰</a><br/><blockquote>53岁日结女工被工头摁在墙上性骚扰，不敢报警：工头只需第二天不叫她干活，就能断掉生计。</blockquote><br/><br/>东林石 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9trtze" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">养老金“公平账”是人民日报这样算的吗？</a><br/><blockquote>体制内平均退休金是农民的30倍，且每月领取的财政补贴，最高者竟是最低者的17倍。</blockquote><br/><br/>极昼工作室 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9trtzj" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">被强制休息的货车司机，不想停下来</a><br/><blockquote>900公里运费仅800元，司机被北斗强制休息却因无处停车只能冒死违停，感叹休息比开车还累。</blockquote><br/><br/>经济学人 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9trtzn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国热衷给城市排名，政府希望它停止</a><br/><blockquote>东北海城花500万买进“百强县”，丑闻曝光后中国政府正下令叫停各类城市排行榜。</blockquote><br/><br/>BBC | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9trtzs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">台湾“九合一”选举五大看点：“洋流”能否撼动台北？谁在卡位2028大选？</a><br/><blockquote>沈伯洋台北民调反超蒋万安，北京罕见点名攻击其家属，这场地方选举已成2028大选前哨战。</blockquote><br/><br/>欢迎大家推荐我们的邮件周报给身边不方便科学上网的朋友，订阅链接：<a href="https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/JzDsfRgs6JsbHc646JP9JUgmF3ZJxzYW_9dw8zvEP9hlYoYEtHUSonrATuanliaR14gPO4nRSQggaXV_Lb99-pTgY1nmsNRvQq5GJNzINuvz7tgh2PLHzOsMHfCiu-jJFbYtoGumz8NCPV5Kuoax6VJpabzaoOVPL8WeXopeU4Sl-F-Ppfj4LYGvbUAgl-w_6I6OSYXzeMvj_tPb2lhcC5KVg7X_EEpCjAKKjdbXkEpiQAdj1jvNyw-UWdJ4GnPrB2ztaRYrl989BVe3RAXwJRvHuin2Ro2_CU8GpYMn1ONnVd7eOXbUfgpfRxX7_h8QfAGFlWQyI1m4XMzF3qpvRw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
